{"id":"n14330-1-7","stage":3,"title":"어기다 · 违反","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14330-1-7-1","ko":"여기에서는 떠들거나 장난치면 안 됩니다.","zh":"在这里不可以大声喧哗或闹着玩。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에서는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에서는","audio":"/audio/5f742d0e08be3e1cec2b.mp3"}},{"text":"떠들거나","meaning":"喧闹","explanation":"떠들다：喧闹；거나：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"떠들다","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64655","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠들거나","audio":"/audio/ceab51ba7663b414806b.mp3"}},{"text":"장난치면","meaning":"闹着玩，开玩笑","explanation":"장난치다：闹着玩，开玩笑；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"장난치다","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75063","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난치면","audio":"/audio/d504992e42974718723e.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니다","audio":"/audio/d5bd67992682ed3f7e8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"11ba432b1719e409","term":"떠들다","zh":"喧闹","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3","entryId":"64655","definition":"喧哗吵闹。","pronunciation":["떠ː들다"]},{"id":"b7e4917842610b07","term":"장난치다","zh":"闹着玩，开玩笑","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3","entryId":"75063","definition":"孩子们为了好玩或消遣而闹得很厉害。","pronunciation":["장난치다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cfbf11b97277cd52f210.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14330-1-7-2","ko":"만약에 규칙을 어기면 어떻게 되나요?","zh":"如果违反规则的话会怎么样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"만약에","meaning":"如果，假如，要是","explanation":"만약：如果，假如，要是；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"만약","audio":"/audio/1ef5375d04ac82d6e41f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93687","senseId":"1","lemma":"만약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만약에","audio":"/audio/74c5302ca2b8c016ccb7.mp3"}},{"text":"규칙을","meaning":"规则，规定，条例","explanation":"규칙：规则，规定，条例；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"규칙","audio":"/audio/c689d4077c924169b4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35269","senseId":"1","lemma":"규칙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"규칙을","audio":"/audio/e4b91c8a56fa0efa4f0c.mp3"}},{"text":"어기면","meaning":"违反，违背","explanation":"어기다：违反，违背；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"어기다","audio":"/audio/e35ab655f9e88a6b3c67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14330","senseId":"1","lemma":"어기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어기면","audio":"/audio/290e38a8bff07fa76bfd.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되나요","audio":"/audio/7ee6d2f020195c6ebb22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1ef5375d04ac82d6","term":"만약","zh":"如果，假如，要是","audio":"/audio/1ef5375d04ac82d6e41f.mp3","entryId":"93687","definition":"或许会发生的意外情况下。","pronunciation":["마ː냑"]},{"id":"c689d4077c924169","term":"규칙","zh":"规则，规定，条例","audio":"/audio/c689d4077c924169b4a4.mp3","entryId":"35269","definition":"规定出来供大家共同遵守的制度。","pronunciation":["규칙"]},{"id":"e35ab655f9e88a6b","term":"어기다","zh":"违反，违背","audio":"/audio/e35ab655f9e88a6b3c67.mp3","entryId":"14330","definition":"不遵守规则或约定、命令等。","pronunciation":["어기다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7296f12cbbdbd818fa57.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14330","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.0577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["如果违反规则的话会怎么样呢？","这是我昨天买的衣服，你觉得怎么样？","在这里不可以大声喧哗或闹着玩。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["如果违反规则的话会怎么样呢？","在这里不可以大声喧哗或闹着玩。","这是我昨天买的衣服，你觉得怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
